  "details": "Swiper is mobile first, layout and gestures wise, it provides great amount of options for designing your own widget and related events.\n\nThis module provides a route for displaying published content entities in a dialog. The route does not sufficiently verify the current user's access to the specific entity.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that only rendered output is returned, and field-level access controls are still enforced.",
